'''Slave Quarters Row''',<ref name="CL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> also called the '''Slave Quarter''',<ref name="Ultimate" /> was an area located on the outskirts<ref name="World Building">{{InsiderCite|227|World Building (Star Wars Insider 227)}}</ref> of [[Mos Espa]], a [[spaceport]] [[city]] on [[Tatooine]]. It consisted of a series of small hovels stacked atop each other that were originally built by the [[mining]] companies who first colonized Tatooine. In the last decades of the [[Galactic Republic]], however, those hovels served as homes for the city's [[Slavery|slave]] population, hence the name "Slave Quarter." [[Anakin Skywalker]] lived out his [[Youngling|childhood]] [[Standard year|years]] with his [[Parent|mother]], [[Shmi Skywalker Lars|Shmi]], in the Slave Quarter, when the two of them were owned by a [[Toydarian]] [[junk dealer]] named [[Watto]].<ref name="Ultimate" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The real-world locations for the Slave Quarters are [[Ksar Hadada]], [[Ksar Medenine]] and [[Ksar Ouled Soltane]] in [[Tunisia]].

